---
---

<section class="section problem-section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="problem-intro fade-up">
      <h2>You Don&rsquo;t Know What Your Website Is Costing You</h2>
      <p>Your website looks fine to you because you built it on a desktop and haven&rsquo;t searched for your agency on a phone in months. Here&rsquo;s what your next client actually sees:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-grid">
      <div class="problem-card fade-up">
        <div class="problem-icon orange">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12.01" y2="18"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Broken on Mobile</h4>
        <p>Text too small to read. Buttons impossible to tap. Forms that don&rsquo;t fit the screen. Over 60% of insurance searches start on a phone.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-card fade-up">
        <div class="problem-icon blue">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Invisible to Google</h4>
        <p>No local SEO. No schema markup. No Google Business Profile connection. Your competitors show up in the map pack &mdash; you don&rsquo;t.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-card fade-up">
        <div class="problem-icon orange">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Phone Number Buried</h4>
        <p>A prospect on their phone can&rsquo;t find your number without scrolling. No click-to-call. No sticky header. They leave and call the next agency.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-card fade-up">
        <div class="problem-icon blue">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>No Clear Next Step</h4>
        <p>No quote form. No &ldquo;Get a Free Quote&rdquo; button. No reason for a visitor to do anything except leave. Your site is a brochure, not a tool.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-card fade-up">
        <div class="problem-icon orange">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Painfully Slow</h4>
        <p>Three-second load times lose half your visitors. Oversized images, bloated plugins, and cheap hosting are silently driving people away before they see a word.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-card fade-up">
        <div class="problem-icon blue">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>No Trust Signals</h4>
        <p>No client reviews. No carrier logos. No team photos. No proof you&rsquo;re real. In insurance, trust is everything &mdash; and your site isn&rsquo;t earning any.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-section {
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .problem-intro {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }

  .problem-intro h2 {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .problem-intro p {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .problem-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px 24px;
    transition: all 0.25s;
  }

  .problem-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow-hover);
    border-color: rgba(244, 128, 33, 0.3);
  }

  .problem-icon {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .problem-icon.orange {
    background: rgba(244, 128, 33, 0.12);
    color: var(--orange);
  }

  .problem-icon.blue {
    background: rgba(41, 63, 80, 0.12);
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  .problem-card h4 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .problem-card p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .problem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
